  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Mocopi Receiver moves an avatar with your Sony mocopi motion sensors, streamed to the Lens over WebSocket by a relay server.
    Look down at the floor and hold still to place the avatar. Start the relay to see it move, and pinch Reset to place it again.
